+/*
+ * The QCA6390's Bluetooth supplies (xnu 0136; apollo's live DT, the bluetooth node: aon and dig
+ * 0xa9, 950 mV; rfa1 0xac, 1.9 V; rfa2 0xad, 1.35 V: the Wi-Fi's rails above; asd 0x38e, 3.024
